    G[User Goal] --> L[Copilot Lead Agent]

    L --> D[Copilot Developer Agent]

    D --> PR[Pull Request]

    PR --> CI[GitHub Actions Gates]

    CI -->|Pass| CR[Copilot / Human Review]
    CI -->|Fail| L

    CR --> V[Validator]

    V --> E[Evaluator]

    E --> H[Human Approval]

    H -->|Approved| M[Merge]
